This repository is the **local-primary edge MCP host** for the Palace memory
kernel (`github.com/iome-sh/memory`). Binary / image name honesty:

  iomesh-memory-mcp
  ghcr.io/iome-sh/iomesh-memory-mcp

It is **not** product Memory GA, not the private aion broker / control plane,
and **dual_write is OFF** by default (audit dual_write is a later optional path).

